{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Review 5G mast planning laws",
        "additional_details": "Relaxed 5G planning laws have seen much larger masts installed across towns - close to where people live, work and children go to school, creating a huge visual disturbance.\r\n \r\nThe appearance of towns must be protected and any potential long term health impact of 5G taken into greater consideration. Potential health impacts are considered in the European Parliament's Panel for the Future of Science and Technology report on the 'Health Impact of 5G'.\r\n \r\nThis petition would like the government to enact more stringent 5G planning laws.",
        "background": "Review 5G mast planning laws to ensure that their visual impact is mitigated and people are safe from any potential long-term harm to health, especially in areas close to homes, schools, nurseries and parks.",
